# Allowlist: ignore everything, then admit only what the image needs. Safer than
# a denylist, because a new secret or large file added to the repo later is
# excluded by default rather than silently copied into the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!data/index/

# Never ship bytecode or the optional Chroma store, even from allowed dirs.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
data/index/chroma/
